  "id": "comparison-level-for-alternatives",
  "term": "comparison level for alternatives",
  "definition": "Comparison level for alternatives is the idea of evaluating a current engagement or relationship against other possible options and deciding whether an alternative would be preferable. In this source, it refers to comparing existing professional involvement with potential alternatives and choosing among them.",
